WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.990
Unit twenty-three. Air Pollution and Smoke!

2
00:00:04.965 --> 00:00:08.812
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.862 --> 00:00:12.254
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.304 --> 00:00:16.464
Today we learn about Air Pollution and Smoke. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:21.204
Air pollution. Say it with me. Air pollution!

6
00:00:24.687 --> 00:00:28.004
Smoke. Say it with me. Smoke!

7
00:00:31.509 --> 00:00:35.093
Lungs. Say it with me. Lungs!

8
00:00:38.577 --> 00:00:42.094
Mask. Say it with me. Mask!

9
00:00:45.603 --> 00:00:48.753
Burning. Say it with me. Burning!

10
00:00:52.265 --> 00:00:55.565
Dust. Say it with me. Dust!

11
00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:02.627
Asthma. Say it with me. Asthma!

12
00:01:06.124 --> 00:01:10.040
Indoors. Say it with me. Indoors!

13
00:01:13.587 --> 00:01:23.058
Air pollution from smoke, dust, and burning rubbish can hurt my lungs. It can make asthma worse. On smoky days, I stay indoors and may wear a mask.

14
00:01:23.108 --> 00:01:24.403
I can do that too!

15
00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:30.805
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.855 --> 00:01:32.005
Lungs!

17
00:01:32.972 --> 00:01:38.118
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.168 --> 00:01:39.318
Asthma!

19
00:01:40.238 --> 00:01:46.681
Did you know? Cooking smoke indoors can also be harmful, so good ventilation matters!

20
00:01:46.731 --> 00:01:48.800
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:49.494 --> 00:01:57.350
Think and answer. What causes air pollution near your home?

22
00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:58.550
Great answer!

23
00:01:59.861 --> 00:02:05.060
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:05.110 --> 00:02:07.875
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

